{"name":"Tretinoin protocol (tret, buffering)","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":26,"casual":{"lead":["The tret protocol is looksmaxxing shorthand for easing into prescription tretinoin and cushioning it with moisturiser, aiming for smoother, clearer, less wrinkled skin with fewer pores and spots.","Tretinoin acts on retinoic acid receptors in skin cells, speeding turnover, normalising follicle keratinisation and, per reports, boosting collagen. It is described as the most extensively studied topical retinoid for photoageing, with studies running up to two years, and is also studied for acne. Buffering is meant to reduce irritation rather than change the mechanism, and reference sources do not describe buffering or slow-ramp schedules specifically."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["People start with infrequent use and increase gradually, often layering moisturiser before or after to reduce irritation, typically at night with daily sunscreen by day. Skin changes build over months. It is prescribed in many countries."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Irritation, redness, peeling and sun sensitivity are common. It is contraindicated in pregnancy. It is available by prescription in many countries."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Preventing posttraumatic stress disorder following childbirth: a systematic review and meta-analysis.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/38122842/","source":"American journal of obstetrics and gynecology","year":2024,"cites":null,"kind":"Meta-Analysis"},{"title":"Effect of Beta-Alanine Supplementation on Maximal Intensity Exercise in Trained Young Male Individuals: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis.","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/39032921/","source":"International journal of sport nutrition and exercise metabolism","year":2024,"cites":null,"kind":"Systematic Review"},{"title":"Mental health trajectories after juridical divorce: Does personality matter?","url":"https://